        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Tax credits are provided for wind and solar energy projects.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The bill represents a major advancement in addressing climate change.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Historically, previous efforts have failed to significantly reduce carbon emissions despite available measures.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There are policies designed to bring clean technology manufacturing—such as batteries, wind turbines, solar panels, and energy storage—back to the United States.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
