    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80548.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Interesting. So what other environmental legislation is maybe moving through Congress right now that you think New Mexicans might be particularly interested in?",
