        "text": "The listener has knowledge about current legislative activity in Congress related to environmental issues.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "New Mexicans have distinct environmental concerns that differ from those of other populations.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Environmental legislation can have region-specific relevance based on geography or local conditions.",
