        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The public values biodiversity and supports proactive environmental policies.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Environmental crises can be mitigated through timely, science-informed interventions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
