    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80548.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "I think there are a number of fundamental problems with this. One is that There's a lot of lip service given to state and local control. But the reality is that New Mexico as a whole has never been sold on this kind of storage. And one of the fundamental reasons, in my view, is that there is no plan for long-term storage. So you can't have temporary storage if you can't even tell me where the long-term storage is going to be. And so what should be a matter of decades of temporary storage is, in my view, it's going to clearly turn into basically permanent",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
